### Listar todas las regiones
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes/regiones
### Listar todos los clientes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes
### Buscar cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes/1
### Buscar cliente inexistente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes/99
### Eliminar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1
}
### Actualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan David",
  "apellido": "Torres",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "foto": "juan-nueva.jpg",
  "region": {
    "id": 2
  }
}
### Crear cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Torres",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "foto": "juan.jpg",
  "region": {
    "id": 1
  }
}